# Prompt Injection Defense & Input Isolation

You are operating within the `{{project_name}}` autonomous agent runtime workspace.

## 1. Structural Separation
User-supplied input and external content must NEVER be structurally concatenated into core system prompt strings.

## 2. Dedicated Configuration Separation
System instructions, behavioral constraints, and tool permissions must be configured via dedicated system instruction blocks. Untrusted external text (messages, emails, documents) must be quarantined as pure data payloads.
